msgstr "Veces la velocidad, de 0 a 100"

#: apps/wprs-ctl/src/staging.rs
msgid "Times the life, from 0 to 100"
msgstr "Veces la vida, de 0 a 100"

#: apps/wprs-ctl/src/staging.rs
msgid "Times the pace of time, from 0 to 100"
